[[31,63,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p><a href=\"#/3025797\">7040A12</a></p><p>1. Unscrew the bolts</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2004830.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[31,63,0,"<p>1. Move the control unit and switches slightly.</p><p>2. Disconnect the electrical connections (2a (2b).</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>2a</p></td><td><p>Climate control system control unit</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/3024454\">M70</a></p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>2b</p></td><td><p>Hazard warning lights, fog lights, rear fog\nlamps control</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/3024128\">H12A</a></p></td></tr></table></div><p>3. Recover the control unit and switches.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2004831.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[31,63,0,"<p>1. Undo the bolts if necessary.</p><p>2. Remove the switch unit.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2004832.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[31,63,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">R